  "steps": [
    "To a bowl add 1 cup semolina, 3/4 cup yogurt, 1/2 cup water, Mix it really well and let it rest. In the meantime, let’s prepare the tempering.",
    "To a pan on medium heat, add 1 tsp oil, 1/2 tsp mustard seeds, 1/2 tsp cumin seeds, 1/2 tsp urad dal, 1 finely chopped onion, 10 chopped curry leaves, Sauté till golden brown and set it aside.",
    "Now transfer the semolina and yogurt mixture into a blender and blend until smooth.",
    "Top it with the prepared tempering and 1/2 a handful of fresh coriander.",
    "Mix everything really well, then, add 1/4 tsp baking soda, 1 tsp salt and 15ml water. Gently fold it all in.",
    "Now heat a tempering pan on very low heat with 1/2 tsp oil. Pour in the batter, cover and cook for 3 minutes or until fully cooked.",
    "Flip it over and cook the other side until nicely golden brown.",
    "And it’s done! Enjoy your soft and fluffy Bun Dosa with some chutney!"
  ],
